        "source": "setcpm(60 / 4)\n\n// The rack clock overrides the tempo above.\n$: note(\"c3 g3 bb3 g3\")\n  .s(\"triangle\").gain(.22)\n  ._punchcard()\n\n// Play the VCO patched into L IN.\n$: s(\"rack ~ rack ~\").gain(.3)\n  .orbit(2).channels(\"3:4\")"
